  "sections": [
   {
    "heading": "Studies made of eighths followed by sixteenths",
    "paragraphs": [
     "To give these studies more lightness, the first eighth must be attacked more dryly than its value shows: play it like a sixteenth, keeping a silence between it and the two sixteenths that follow.",
     "The same holds when an eighth comes after the sixteenths instead of before them."
    ]
   }
  ],
